{"id":"a4f4e261ae1cc2d8","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-model9-model-filter-genericity.md","title":"ZFC Model9 Model Filter Genericity","display":"df-zfc-model9-model-filter-genericity — ZFC Model9 Model Filter Genericity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model9-model-filter-genericity","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model9-model-filter-genericity"],"display":"df-zfc-model9-model-filter-genericity — ZFC Model9 Model Filter Genericity","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model9-model-filter-genericity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model9-model-filter-genericity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model9-model-filter-genericity — ZFC Model9 Model Filter Genericity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,M,P,\\Gamma,X,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(G,M,P,\\Gamma,X,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelFilterGenericity}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelFilterGenericity}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}model\\text{-}filter\\text{-}genericity} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelFilterGenericity}_S(G,M,P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Gamma,X,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(P=\\langle X,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\n\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,X,\\leq_P,G)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}model\\text{-}filter\\text{-}genericity} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelFilterGenericity}_S(G,M,P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Gamma,X,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(P=\\langle X,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\n\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,X,\\leq_P,G)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The poset parameter is a set-coded pair, so its carrier and order cannot drift apart.</li>\n<li>Genericity, filterhood, transitivity of the model, and membership of the forcing notion in the model are inherited from the cited forcing setup.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,M,P,\\Gamma,X,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelFilterGenericity}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}model\\text{-}filter\\text{-}genericity} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelFilterGenericity}_S(G,M,P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Gamma,X,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(P=\\langle X,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\n\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,X,\\leq_P,G)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1194,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2820","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-model9-model-filter-genericity.md|58-df-zfc-model9-model-filter-genericity]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d06ac5a66d69d291"]}